  "chapter_readings": [
    {
      "text": "The children carry the radio home. Tom presses the blue button. A little cloud flies out of the radio, and it smells of cinnamon. “Hi, explorers!” says a cheerful voice. “My name is Radiophone. In your garden, under the old tree, there is a key. Bring a flashlight and a piece of cheese!”",
